<title>USA: N.Y. metal futures opening forecasts.</title>
<headline>N.Y. metal futures opening forecasts.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>New York metals futures were called to open by traders as follows:</p>
<p>COMEX August gold - down $0.30 to $0.50 an ounce</p>
<p>COMEX July silver - down 1.00 to 2.00 cents</p>
<p>NYMEX July platinum - unchanged to up $1.00</p>
<p>NYMEX Sept palladium - up $2.00 to $3.00</p>
<p>COMEX July copper -  down 0.20 to 0.50 cent per lb</p>
<p>((New York Commodity Desk 212-859-1640))</p>
</text>
